# The inbox comes to you (P4): at acme's first desk, the busy fixture (5 active cats, a letter):
# api-gateway (blocked), alpha (done) and the postman leave their rooms and come; the ones that fit
# hop onto the desk tops beside your screen, in view, the rest sit on the floor before you.
key J
wait 500
inject cats {"fixture":"busy"}
wait json /ext/cats/inbox/visible 3 4000
wait 12000
shot ${OUT}/shot-cats-inbox.png
dump ${OUT}/dump-cats-inbox.json
quit
